{"text": "realization", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\">r\u00e9alisation</i>, from Middle French; equivalent to <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">realize</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ation</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": " An act of figuring out or becoming aware.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": " The act of making real.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Coordinate terms": ["embodiment", "eventualization", "incarnation", "instantiation", "execution"]}}, {"definition": " The result of an artistic effort.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": " The act of realizing, as:\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["US", "/\u02cc\u0279i\u0259l\u026a\u02c8ze\u026a\u0283\u0259n/"], ["UK", "/\u02cc\u0279\u026a\u0259la\u026a\u02c8ze\u026a\u0283\u0259n/"]]}